{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超出發訪問北京和上海。</p>\n<p>行政長官李家超早上抵達機場，他會先到北京出席周三上午舉行的京港洽談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面；同日轉往上海，周四出席進博會開幕式，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭，周五返港。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:36.607934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:58:38.848437+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:53.673972+00:00","content_hash":"a1db438c51c7581f4433223aa0a3e8dd296cbc7c85264228bb4af1fdefa29c1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:36.607934+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}